world  corrected pendulum cascade

-- Revised, unverified construction.
-- Gravity assumes MuJoCo's default 9.81 m/s².
-- Every body starts with zero velocity and zero spin.
-- Numeric restitution is unavailable: bounce dead is used instead.
-- Cart slides are approximated by 1000 m-radius hinges.
-- Their effective linear damping is 0.20 N·s/m.
-- Ring1 is enlarged to clear the cube and the seesaw.
-- Slotted surfaces and stored spring energy assist the transfers.
-- Expectations are checks to run, not claimed results.

